{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高数", "topics": ["渐近线", "导数应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": [], "answer": "B", "explanation": "当 $x\\to+\\infty$ 时，\n$$\n\\ln\\left(e+\\frac{1}{x-1}\\right)\n=1+\\ln\\left(1+\\frac{1}{e(x-1)}\\right)\n=1+\\frac{1}{e(x-1)}+o\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right).\n$$\n故\n$$\ny=x+\\frac{x}{e(x-1)}+o(1)\\to x+\\frac{1}{e}.\n$$\n斜渐近线为 $y=x+\\frac{1}{e}$，选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高数", "topics": ["微分方程", "二阶微分方程", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": [], "answer": "C", "explanation": "方程特征根满足\n$$\n\\lambda^2+a\\lambda+b=0.\n$$\n要使所有解在 $(-\\infty,+\\infty)$ 上有界，不能有非零实部，也不能有零根导致常数以外的增长项。因此特征根应为一对纯虚根\n$$\n\\lambda=\\pm i\\sqrt{b},\n$$\n即\n$$\na=0,\\qquad b>0.\n$$\n选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高数", "topics": ["导数", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": [], "answer": "C", "explanation": "当 $t\\ge0$ 时，\n$$\nx=3t,\\qquad y=t\\sin t.\n$$\n当 $t<0$ 时，\n$$\nx=t,\\qquad y=-t\\sin t.\n$$\n两侧均有 $f'(0)=0$，且 $f'(x)\\to0$，所以 $f'(x)$ 在 $0$ 处连续。\n\n但二阶导数左右极限不同：右侧 $y\\sim t^2=x^2/9$，左侧 $y\\sim -x^2$，故 $f''(0)$ 不存在。选 C。", "methods": ["参数方程求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高数", "topics": ["级数", "敛散性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": [], "answer": "A", "explanation": "因为 $a_n<b_n$，所以 $c_n=b_n-a_n>0$。又\n$$\n\\sum c_n=\\sum b_n-\\sum a_n\n$$\n收敛，故 $\\sum c_n$ 绝对收敛。\n\n若 $\\sum a_n$ 绝对收敛，则\n$$\nb_n=a_n+c_n\n$$\n推出 $\\sum b_n$ 绝对收敛。反过来，若 $\\sum b_n$ 绝对收敛，则\n$$\na_n=b_n-c_n\n$$\n推出 $\\sum a_n$ 绝对收敛。故为充分必要条件，选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "线代", "topics": ["秩"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": [], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由 $ABC=O$，对\n$$\nM_1=\\begin{pmatrix}O&A\\\\BC&E\\end{pmatrix}\n$$\n用 Schur 补可得\n$$\nr_1=n+r(-ABC)=n.\n$$\n类似地\n$$\nr_2=n+r(AB).\n$$\n而\n$$\nM_3=\\begin{pmatrix}E&AB\\\\AB&O\\end{pmatrix}\n$$\n的秩为\n$$\nr_3=n+r((AB)^2)\\le n+r(AB)=r_2.\n$$\n又 $r_3\\ge n=r_1$，故\n$$\nr_1\\le r_3\\le r_2.\n$$\n选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "线代", "topics": ["特征值与特征向量", "相似矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": [], "answer": "D", "explanation": "A 的特征值 $1,2,3$ 互异，可对角化；B 为实对称矩阵，可正交对角化；C 对特征值 $2$ 的几何重数为 $2$，也可对角化。\n\nD 的特征值为 $1,2,2$。对 $\\lambda=2$，\n$$\nA-2E=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1&1&a\\\\\n0&0&2\\\\\n0&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n其零空间维数为 $1$，小于特征值 $2$ 的代数重数 $2$，故不能相似于对角矩阵。选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "线代", "topics": ["向量组"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": [], "answer": "D", "explanation": "设\n$$\n\\gamma=s\\alpha_1+t\\alpha_2=u\\beta_1+v\\beta_2.\n$$\n即\n$$\ns(1,2,3)^T+t(2,1,1)^T\n=u(2,5,9)^T+v(1,0,1)^T.\n$$\n解该齐次交集条件，得公共向量空间由\n$$\n(1,5,8)^T\n$$\n张成。因此\n$$\n\\gamma=k(1,5,8)^T,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb R.\n$$\n选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["泊松分布"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": [], "answer": "C", "explanation": "若 $X\\sim P(1)$，则 $E(X)=1$。于是\n$$\nE|X-1|\n=P(X=0)+\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty}(k-1)P(X=k).\n$$\n又由 $E(X-1)=0$ 得\n$$\n\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty}(k-1)P(X=k)=P(X=0)=e^{-1}.\n$$\n所以\n$$\nE|X-E(X)|=\\frac{2}{e}.\n$$\n选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["正态分布", "抽样分布"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": [], "answer": "D", "explanation": "有\n$$\n\\frac{(n-1)S_1^2}{\\sigma^2}\\sim\\chi^2(n-1),\\qquad\n\\frac{(m-1)S_2^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\sim\\chi^2(m-1),\n$$\n且相互独立。因此\n$$\n\\frac{S_1^2}{S_2^2/2}\n=\\frac{2S_1^2}{S_2^2}\n\\sim F(n-1,m-1).\n$$\n选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["正态分布", "抽样分布", "参数估计"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": [], "answer": "A", "explanation": "因为\n$$\nX_1-X_2\\sim N(0,2\\sigma^2),\n$$\n若 $Z\\sim N(0,\\tau^2)$，则\n$$\nE|Z|=\\tau\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{\\pi}}.\n$$\n故\n$$\nE|X_1-X_2|=\\sqrt{2}\\sigma\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{\\pi}}\n=\\frac{2\\sigma}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}.\n$$\n要使 $a|X_1-X_2|$ 无偏估计 $\\sigma$，需\n$$\na\\cdot\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}=1,\n$$\n即\n$$\na=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{2}.\n$$\n选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高数", "topics": ["极限", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$-2$", "explanation": "展开得\n$$\nf(x)=ax+bx^2+\\ln(1+x)\n=(a+1)x+\\left(b-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)x^2+O(x^3).\n$$\n又\n$$\ng(x)=e^{x^2}-\\cos x\n=\\left(1+x^2+O(x^4)\\right)-\\left(1-\\frac{x^2}{2}+O(x^4)\\right)\n=\\frac{3}{2}x^2+O(x^4).\n$$\n二者等价，故一次项为 $0$，二次项系数相同：\n$$\na+1=0,\\qquad b-\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$\n所以\n$$\na=-1,\\qquad b=2,\\qquad ab=-2.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高数", "topics": ["空间解析几何"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$x+2y-z=0$", "explanation": "设\n$$\nz=x+2y+\\ln(1+x^2+y^2).\n$$\n在 $(0,0)$ 处，\n$$\nz_x=1+\\frac{2x}{1+x^2+y^2}=1,\\qquad\nz_y=2+\\frac{2y}{1+x^2+y^2}=2.\n$$\n故切平面为\n$$\nz=0+1\\cdot x+2\\cdot y,\n$$\n即\n$$\nx+2y-z=0.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高数", "topics": ["函数性质"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$0$", "explanation": "这是 $[0,1]$ 上的余弦展开，系数为\n$$\na_n=2\\int_0^1(1-x)\\cos(n\\pi x)\\,dx.\n$$\n分部积分或直接计算可得\n$$\na_n=\\frac{2[1-(-1)^n]}{n^2\\pi^2}.\n$$\n当 $n$ 为偶数时，$a_n=0$。因此\n$$\n\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_{2n}=0.\n$$", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高数", "topics": ["连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\displaystyle \\frac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "由\n$$\nf(x+2)=f(x)+x\n$$\n得\n$$\n\\int_1^3f(x)\\,dx\n=\\int_1^2f(x)\\,dx+\\int_2^3f(x)\\,dx.\n$$\n令 $x=u+2$，则\n$$\n\\int_2^3f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^1 f(u+2)\\,du\n=\\int_0^1[f(u)+u]\\,du.\n$$\n所以\n$$\n\\int_1^3f(x)\\,dx\n=\\int_0^2 f(x)\\,dx+\\int_0^1u\\,du\n=0+\\frac{1}{2}\n=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "线代", "topics": ["向量组"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\displaystyle \\frac{11}{9}$", "explanation": "由条件\n$$\n\\gamma^T\\alpha_i=\\beta^T\\alpha_i\\quad(i=1,2,3)\n$$\n且 $\\gamma=k_1\\alpha_1+k_2\\alpha_2+k_3\\alpha_3$，可得\n$$\nGk=b,\n$$\n其中\n$$\nG=(\\alpha_i^T\\alpha_j)=3E,\\qquad\nb=(\\beta^T\\alpha_1,\\beta^T\\alpha_2,\\beta^T\\alpha_3)^T=(1,-3,-1)^T.\n$$\n所以\n$$\nk=\\left(\\frac{1}{3},-1,-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^T.\n$$\n因此\n$$\nk_1^2+k_2^2+k_3^2\n=\\frac{1}{9}+1+\\frac{1}{9}\n=\\frac{11}{9}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["随机变量"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\displaystyle \\frac{1}{3}$", "explanation": "$X\\sim B(1,1/3)$，$Y\\sim B(2,1/2)$，且相互独立。因此\n$$\nP\\{X=Y\\}=P(X=0,Y=0)+P(X=1,Y=1).\n$$\n计算得\n$$\nP(X=0,Y=0)=\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{6},\n$$\n$$\nP(X=1,Y=1)=\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{6}.\n$$\n故\n$$\nP\\{X=Y\\}=\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高数", "topics": ["多元函数", "切线与法线", "导数应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": [], "answer": "(I) $y=x(2-\\ln x)$；(II) 最大值为 $\\displaystyle \\frac{e^4}{4}-\\frac{5}{4}$。", "explanation": "切线在 $y$ 轴上的截距为\n$$\ny-xy'.\n$$\n点 $P(x,y)$ 到 $y$ 轴的距离为 $x$，故\n$$\ny-xy'=x.\n$$\n即\n$$\ny'-\\frac{1}{x}y=-1.\n$$\n令 $y=xu$，则 $y'=u+xu'$，代入得\n$$\nxu'=-1.\n$$\n所以\n$$\nu=-\\ln x+C,\n$$\n由 $y(1)=2$ 得 $C=2$，故\n$$\ny=x(2-\\ln x).\n$$\n\n设\n$$\nf(x)=\\int_1^x t(2-\\ln t)\\,dt.\n$$\n则 $f'(x)=x(2-\\ln x)$。在 $(0,e^2)$ 上 $f'(x)>0$，在 $(e^2,+\\infty)$ 上 $f'(x)<0$，故最大值在 $x=e^2$ 处取得。\n\n原函数为\n$$\n\\int x(2-\\ln x)\\,dx=\\frac{5}{4}x^2-\\frac{1}{2}x^2\\ln x.\n$$\n因此最大值为\n$$\nf(e^2)=\\frac{e^4}{4}-\\frac{5}{4}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "高数", "topics": ["多元函数", "极值与最值", "导数应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": [], "answer": "极小值为 $\\displaystyle f\\left(\\frac{2}{3},\\frac{10}{27}\\right)=-\\frac{4}{729}$。", "explanation": "设\n$$\nf(x,y)=(y-x^2)(y-x^3).\n$$\n求偏导：\n$$\nf_y=2y-x^2-x^3,\n$$\n$$\nf_x=-(2x+3x^2)y+5x^4.\n$$\n由 $f_y=0$ 得\n$$\ny=\\frac{x^2+x^3}{2}.\n$$\n代入 $f_x=0$，得\n$$\nx^3(3x-2)(x-1)=0.\n$$\n驻点为\n$$\n(0,0),\\quad \\left(\\frac{2}{3},\\frac{10}{27}\\right),\\quad (1,1).\n$$\n其中 $(0,0)$ 与 $(1,1)$ 不是极值点；在\n$$\n\\left(\\frac{2}{3},\\frac{10}{27}\\right)\n$$\n处，\n$$\ny-x^2=-\\frac{2}{27},\\qquad y-x^3=\\frac{2}{27},\n$$\n故\n$$\nf\\left(\\frac{2}{3},\\frac{10}{27}\\right)\n=-\\frac{4}{729}.\n$$\n该点为极小值点，所以极小值为 $-\\frac{4}{729}$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "高数", "topics": ["曲面积分", "面积与体积", "空间解析几何"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\displaystyle I=\\frac{5\\pi}{4}$", "explanation": "由高斯公式，\n$$\nI=\\iiint_{\\Omega}\n\\left[\n\\frac{\\partial(2xz)}{\\partial x}\n+\\frac{\\partial(xz\\cos y)}{\\partial y}\n+\\frac{\\partial(3yz\\sin x)}{\\partial z}\n\\right]dV.\n$$\n即\n$$\nI=\\iiint_{\\Omega}\\left(2z-xz\\sin y+3y\\sin x\\right)dV.\n$$\n区域为\n$$\nx^2+y^2\\le1,\\qquad 0\\le z\\le1-x.\n$$\n由于关于 $y$ 对称，含 $\\sin y$ 或因子 $y$ 的两项积分为 $0$。故\n$$\nI=\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}\\int_0^{1-x}2z\\,dz\\,dxdy\n=\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}(1-x)^2\\,dxdy.\n$$\n于是\n$$\nI=\\iint_D(1-2x+x^2)\\,dA\n=\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\n=\\frac{5\\pi}{4}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "高数", "topics": ["极值与最值", "导数应用", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": [], "answer": "证明见解析。", "explanation": "(I) 构造二次插值余项。设\n$$\nF(x)=f(x)-\\frac{f(a)+f(-a)}{2a^2}x^2.\n$$\n由 $f(0)=0$，有\n$$\nF(a)+F(-a)=f(a)+f(-a)-[f(a)+f(-a)]=0.\n$$\n又 $F$ 在 $[-a,a]$ 上二阶连续，由两次应用中值定理，可知存在 $\\xi\\in(-a,a)$ 使\n$$\nF''(\\xi)=0.\n$$\n因此\n$$\nf''(\\xi)=\\frac{f(a)+f(-a)}{a^2}.\n$$\n\n(II) 若 $f$ 在 $(-a,a)$ 内取得极值，设极值点为 $x_0$，则 $f'(x_0)=0$。由拉格朗日中值定理，\n$$\nf(a)-f(x_0)=f'(\\xi_1)(a-x_0),\n$$\n$$\nf(x_0)-f(-a)=f'(\\xi_2)(x_0+a)\n$$\n对某些 $\\xi_1,\\xi_2\\in(-a,a)$ 成立。再由 $f'(x_0)=0$，对 $f'$ 应用中值定理，可得存在 $\\eta\\in(-a,a)$，使\n$$\n|f''(\\eta)|\\ge\n\\frac{|f(a)-f(-a)|}{2a^2}.\n$$\n即结论成立。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "线代", "topics": ["逆矩阵", "二次型", "正交变换"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": [], "answer": "(I) 可取 $\\displaystyle P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&1\\\\0&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$；(II) 不存在正交变换。", "explanation": "二次型 $f$ 的矩阵为\n$$\nA=\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1&-1\\\\\n1&2&0\\\\\n-1&0&2\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n$g$ 的矩阵为\n$$\nB=\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0\\\\\n0&1&1\\\\\n0&1&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n取\n$$\nP=\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&-1&1\\\\\n0&1&0\\\\\n0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n直接计算得\n$$\nP^TAP=B.\n$$\n因此可逆变换 $x=Py$ 可将 $f$ 化为 $g$。\n\n若存在正交变换 $x=Qy$，则应有\n$$\nQ^TAQ=B,\n$$\n这意味着 $A$ 与 $B$ 正交相似，从而特征值相同。但\n$$\nA\n$$\n的特征值为 $0,2,3$，而 $B$ 的特征值为 $0,1,2$，二者不同。因此不存在这样的正交变换。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2023", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2023, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["概率密度", "联合分布", "方差", "协方差与相关系数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": [], "answer": "(I) $\\operatorname{Cov}(X,Y)=0$；(II) 不相互独立；(III) $f_Z(z)=2z,\\ 0<z<1$，其他为 $0$。", "explanation": "(I) 密度只依赖于 $x^2+y^2$，且区域关于坐标轴对称。因此\n$$\nEX=EY=0,\\qquad E(XY)=0.\n$$\n故\n$$\n\\operatorname{Cov}(X,Y)=E(XY)-EX\\,EY=0.\n$$\n\n(II) $X,Y$ 的联合密度支撑集为单位圆盘，不是直积区域；例如当 $X$ 接近 $1$ 时，$Y$ 只能接近 $0$。因此 $X$ 与 $Y$ 不相互独立。\n\n(III) 令\n$$\nZ=X^2+Y^2=r^2.\n$$\n在极坐标下\n$$\nf_{X,Y}(x,y)=\\frac{2}{\\pi}r^2,\n$$\n且 $dxdy=r\\,dr\\,d\\theta=\\frac{1}{2}\\,dz\\,d\\theta$。于是当 $0<z<1$ 时，\n$$\nf_Z(z)=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{2}{\\pi}z\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}\\,d\\theta=2z.\n$$\n其他处为 $0$。", "methods": []}
